Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.02,0:01:31.40,Date Shadow,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\c&HE8F0E6&\pos(315,368)}August 1st
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had a really cool\Nreunion to celebrate the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anniversary of our first\Ntrip to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Us older DigiDestined filled in the new\Nones about the stories from the early days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't know that there\Nwas a strange dark shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.46,0:01:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that had started appearing\Nall over the TV station.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was actually our old friend, Wizardmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd come to warn us\Nthat the Digimon Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't the only evil we\Nneed to watch out for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something even\Nmore powerful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:02:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the only way we can defeat\Nit is with the Golden Radiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he means.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.68,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fscx115\fscy115\pos(318,318)}Track Down the Kaiser's Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope the others are\Nhaving more luck than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Cody's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.46,0:02:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two get up here right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be right there, Tentomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it. I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.58,0:02:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing things, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at all those. There's\Nhundreds of control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And hundreds of evil Digimon slaves, too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Digimon It seems to me the Dark\NTyrannomon are coming out of that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strange dome I'll bet you that's where\Nthe Digimon Emperor's headquarters are
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, we better take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we don't need your help, Tentomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can Digivolve\Nwith all these control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they haven't spotted us yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I should have\Nbrought my giant flyswatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him, Digmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor, energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, armor digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digmon, the drill of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I have this dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My D3's going wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So nice of you to drop\Nin on my headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It saves me the time of hunting you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to at least try to Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.64,0:03:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:03:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:04:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times do I\Nhave to tell you people
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.98,0:04:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're sitting in the Digivolving section?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Digmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I know how to dig a hole or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.26,0:04:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're in the clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no control spires here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.31,0:04:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give it another shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.52,0:04:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon, digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's Kabuterimon. I think\NI'll add him to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's everyone is my mom here no\Nwe were lucky we all made it back
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before she got home that was close so\Nwhat did you guys find in your area
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the whole place was covered with a\Nbunch of control spires i knew it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there must have been a control spire\Nconvention in town tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.34,0:04:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were hundreds of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found something else, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Digimon Emperor's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.28,0:05:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,base.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.19,0:05:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His base? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep my eyes on things here\Nand report back if there's any
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.55,0:05:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody should take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, look at the area that\NDavis and his group explored.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next is the area that TK's group was in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here's where my group was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we connect them together...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a circus clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love this game. No, Daisuke, it's\Na path. It's taking over all the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,areas talk about nesting there'll\Nbe nothing left of our world
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.42,0:05:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not to mention our friends\Nthat's it now i'm really starting
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get upset if we could only\Ndestroy that base wait a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's it if we destroy the\Nemperor's headquarters then the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,control spires will be useless\Nthat makes a lot of sense so why
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are we sitting around here like\Na bunch of yahoos i say we go
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the digital world find his base\Nand rip it up like a bad chap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Chibimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:05:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.73,0:06:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk up there and say, excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.10,0:06:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you mind if we take a couple of\Nminutes and tear down this building?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose we have to come\Nup with some sort of plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right, but it's going\Nto take a lot of thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I also think it's going to take\Nlonger than one day to accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.63,0:06:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose if we all had to\Nbe back by a certain time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be able to concentrate\Non destroying the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.86,0:06:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we all have to agree on one thing we\Ndon't return until the base is destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.86,0:06:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh you mean i don't know if i'm not\Nthere for my mom's tuna casserole she'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.18,0:06:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know something's wrong i haven't missed\None in two years just make up some
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.18,0:06:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,excuse to tell her something like you got\Npicked by the army for a secret mission
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to mars if you told your parents that\Nthey'd actually believe you of course not
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they don't believe anything i say with\Nall these control spires in the digital
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world there's no way our digimon will\Never be able to digiball that means that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Us older kids would be useless if we\Ngo to the Digital World with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true, Matt,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there are other ways we can help\Nout without actually going with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:06:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While you guys go to the digital world,\Nthe rest of us will go on a camping trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.18,0:07:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does it help us if\Nwe're fighting the Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emperor while you're\Nroasting marshmallows?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.60,0:07:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.51,0:07:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll tell all our parents\Nthat we're going camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if they call the campgrounds and\Nno one's there, we'll get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the older kids will go\Ncamping for real and cover you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great idea, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, we get to go camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.66,0:07:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tough job, but someone's got to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in! Oh, you're home. Hello, hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom: Hello, hi kids. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inside on such a nice day well we were\Ndiscussing going on a camping trip for
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our next vacation oh that sounds like\Nfun but you're going to need a chaperone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who's the adult that's going with you\Nuh oh don't worry my dad will go with us
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.22,0:07:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he loves traveling the world are you\Nsure no but it sounded good what you want
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me to go camping with you please dad i\Nalready promised the others you would
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:08:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do it just think of it being out in\Nthe wilderness among all the snakes and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the wolves and the grizzly bears it'll\Nbe fun hey dad tell us again about the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.68,0:08:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time you were chased by a grizzly bear\Ndon't you kids have homework what are
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.74,0:08:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you doing none of your business looks\Nlike you're packing for a camping trip
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's your imagination are tk and the\Nothers going i can't remember so then is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.74,0:08:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,matt going camping too matt moved to\Nanother country well if you're going and
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.86,0:08:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is going, and Matt's going.\NCan I go too? Sure. You can go. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,police still have no clue as to the\Nwhereabouts of boy genius ken itchy joe g who
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mysteriously disappeared some time ago\Nif anyone has seen my son please contact
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the police right away that kid's still\Nlost i hope he's not alone somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cold and hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's helpless without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, if they only knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.22,0:08:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also think it's going to take\Nlonger than one day to accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:08:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we all have to agree on one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't return until\Nthe base is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.30,0:09:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm going to be gone a\Nlong time and I'll miss my soap operas,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am totally up for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to be up at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.26,0:09:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We went to bed hours ago some of us are\Ntrying to sleep good night yeah good night
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digimon emperor prepare to go down we're\Ngonna teach that evil genius a lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll never forget he's excited to go\Ni know she's been like this all night
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoli, save some\Nfor the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Left, right, left, right, and halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a lot to learn about women, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.14,0:09:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be safe. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.72,0:09:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the battle begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:09:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiport open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.74,0:10:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rugged camping men, all set to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.50,0:10:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yep thanks for taking us yeah well\Ni guess we should get going right
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hi there matt i'm ready huh isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that davis's sister what's she doing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here i have no idea we'll see what\Nyou can do to get rid of her okay
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right hey june what's going on i\Nthought this camping trip would be a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect romantic getaway for us. Oh, I\Nsee. Lucky Matt. Girls must chase him all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,day i know exactly how he feels by\Nthe way where's davis and the others
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh those guys they went ahead of us\Nin another car a friend of my dad's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:11:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has a really big minivan where do i\Nsit uh first i have a present to give
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you huh me yeah but it's in the car\Nand i didn't get a chance to wrap it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so close your eyes and count to ten, and\NI'll be right back with your present, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.76,0:11:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two. Okay, Dad. Step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to leave her here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a lot to learn about women, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did I hear that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine. Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's my present?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon Emperor's Base\Nis up here! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this isn't a track meet. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:12:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to be a fly in your suit,\Nbut the Emperor's Base is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's have a look his base was right\Nhere maybe it was a mobile home
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since he was leaving he could have\Ndone the polite thing and taken those
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Control Spires with him. Has anyone\Nseen you? Lee, look down there. Can we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take the scenic route are you sure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.66,0:12:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you saw it maybe it was a garage you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.30,0:12:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mean a mirage no I'm and a place where\Nthe Digimon Emperor keeps his car.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can a whole building\Nsimply disappear into thin air?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Ken's friends with\Na really good magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We keep on looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We promise not to leave\Nuntil the base is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find his headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is follow the\Nbuilding tracks in the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.96,0:12:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli seems to be losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:12:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.76,0:13:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the entire building just flew right up
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that happened, someone\Nwould have seen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.59,0:13:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was you! Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.72,0:13:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were guarding this area\Nthe entire time we were gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now tell us what you saw, or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop yelling at Tentomon, Yoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tried!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.43,0:13:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he should have tried harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.74,0:13:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really doesn't mean any of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's been under a lot of strain lately!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must she yell at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't she take a yoga class or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's she doing now i'm\Nnot going to ask her as
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long as she has that hammer\Nin her hand troops i'm off
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to scout the digimon\Nemperor's underground empire
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.26,0:13:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'll report back soon with\Ngood news yoli wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yoli what are you doing\Nare you losing your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mind what has gotten\Ninto you lately not to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mention that this\Nadventure is different i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a highly motivated woman and i can achieve
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, it's the dreaded Dokugumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an insect-type Digimon whose\Nspecial attack is Poison Thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to get\Ncaught up in his web.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison Thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.56,0:14:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon, hurry, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demons, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.52,0:14:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.78,0:14:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beemon, Armor Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.34,0:14:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon, a fire of courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got this, Yoling!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon! Hawkmon! Hawkmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a buster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's Hawkmon doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wrapped him up in bandages.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.34,0:16:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we just have to keep\Nhim safe until he heals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.44,0:16:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure was brave saving Yoli like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here and take\Ncare of Agumon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.42,0:16:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys, go out and find\Nthe Emperor's headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.99,0:16:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to cause\Ntrouble for anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.06,0:16:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.36,0:16:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Right, I'll.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:17:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stay here you will
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more of the Digimon Emperor slaves might
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attack so we'd better have got him on around\Nas a bodyguard good point all right if
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything happens we can always email each\Nother and you'll always know where we
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are through the d3s if we haven't found\Nthe base by nightfall we'll come back here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.34,0:17:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay. See you later. Be\Ncareful. Yeah, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could possibly go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.78,0:17:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.91,0:17:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I know you're trying to do what's\Nright and win this battle and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're going about\Nit the wrong way. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried the same thing one\Ntime, but I was wrong, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to work together\Nas a team, right, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad we got\Nthat straightened out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:18:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to see if I can\Nfind some herbs to help Hawkmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of control\Nspires around here. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting tired of all this\Nconstruction in my beautiful forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.54,0:18:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we're through here, this\Nplace will be good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.82,0:18:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it was,\Nbut it came from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some kind of shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a tour. Come\Non. Oh, sorry. I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.86,0:18:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.18,0:18:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to be finished with that\Npart an hour ago. Sorry, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to finish the dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heads, I win
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:19:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're safe now I'll take care of you Just\Nrelax Hawkmon, what can I do to apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get off my tail
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I found catnip. It cures it all.\NOkay, but let's give them a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you see i thought this\Nwas my chance to prove
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.26,0:19:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to myself that i was as\Nstrong as everyone else i
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't realize that\Ntaking matters into my own
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hands could wind up hurting\Nsomeone Especially you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was too stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, what happened to\Nyou today is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.92,0:19:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like when my mind gets set on something,\NI just can't stop until I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.84,0:19:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll understand if you want to find someone\Nelse to be your partner from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're missing the point, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those qualities you described\Nare what makes you who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, I like you exactly the way you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.40,0:20:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise to stubbornly attack\Nmy problem of being stubborn,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'll never do anything\Nto hurt you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can start now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.10,0:20:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one and two and one and two.
