Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't felt this good in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all because of catnip. Who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Koromon.
