Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, really, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.52,0:20:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to hear more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you guys hear that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.12,0:20:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's climb out here where\Nwe can get a better look.
