Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be the Digimon Emperor's base.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, I'm sorry we doubted you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.96,0:20:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is flying.
